        <mxCell id="sg-custom" value="hoang-sg-test (Custom SG)&#xa;—————————————————&#xa;✅ INBOUND:&#xa;TCP 22 (SSH) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;TCP 80 (HTTP) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;TCP 443 (HTTPS) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;TCP 5432 (PostgreSQL) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;TCP/UDP 2049 (NFS) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;TCP/UDP 111 (rpcbind) — 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;✅ OUTBOUND: All traffic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=9;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="zone-sg">
